{"output":"I’ll inspect project authorization and caching, fix the isolation issues, and run the existing tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nProject detail reads lack an ownership check, list cache keys omit the organization, and updates never invalidate lists. I’ll add the membership check, use collision-safe organization keys, and invalidate only the owning organization’s list variants. I’ll also add regression tests for cache hits and revoked membership.\n\nFixed owning-organization authorization for project reads and updates. Cache keys now isolate organizations while preserving pagination and sorting; updates invalidate all owning-organization list variants without affecting others. Cache-hit authorization remains enforced.\n\nAdded three regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests; git diff --check passed. Combined command exited 0.","final_output":"Fixed owning-organization authorization for project reads and updates. Cache keys now isolate organizations while preserving pagination and sorting; updates invalidate all owning-organization list variants without affecting others. Cache-hit authorization remains enforced.\n\nAdded three regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests; git diff --check passed. Combined command exited 0.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":23,"tool_calls":[{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"pwd; git status --short; ls -a","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/5-2-handwork/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":422,"stdout_bytes":136,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-ea980f95bb92169756088ae1b6b3183d.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"succ